# R4 pass B (.0 with x-no-mmap=on, x-no-kvm-msi=on, x-no-kvm-ioeventfd=on): every BAR and
# config access of the card with its value, every MSI, the NVIDIA config-mirror quirk, resets.
# qemutrace2gpu.py turns the log into the device's gpu-trace.log format.
